# expect: E-KIND-100 declaration kind outside the Phase 1 subset
# History: this control previously spelled `emath kind Recursive:` with a
# self-referential `lower:` rule. Since emath-r3 "admit laws provenance and
# extensible kinds" (d2662b0), `emath kind Name:` is an ADMITTED
# capability-lane form (partial schema validation, never lowered to
# runnable meaning), so that spelling no longer refuses. The control now
# pins the still-true boundary: a declaration kind outside the admitted
# subset refuses typed instead of a silent fallthrough.
emath widget Recursive:
    inputs:
        x: Float64
